Seems to me the right way to get dragon scale mail from a dragon
corpse is to (a)pply a can opener to it.  Really.  Just peel and wear.
Natch, I'm envisioning the blade type can opener, not the gear-wheel
type one.

If you want to make it more complicated, include a punch-awl and some
rawhide lacing among the game's commodities:

#define HARD
(a)pply can opener to green dragon corpse
you sit down to peel the green dragon corpse (more)
the dead green dragon's mother attacks; (more)
you stop peeling the green dragon corpse
[hack, slash, claw, "ow", claw, "yeowch", hack, slash, expire]
(a)pply can opener to green dragon corpse
you sit down to peel the green dragon corpse (more)
you now have a green dragon hide
(a)pply punch-awl to green dragon hide
you sit down to perforate the green dragon hide (more)
the dead green dragon's father attacks; (more)
you stop punching lace holes in the green dragon hide
[hack, slash, tail swipe, "oof", hack, slash, expire]
(a)pply punch-awl to green dragon hide
you sit down to perforate the green dragon hide (more)
you now have a perforated green dragon hide
(a)pply rawhide laces to perforated green dragon hide
you sit down to lace the perforated green dragon hide (more)
the dead green dragon's immense boyfriend attacks; (more)
you stop lacing the green dragon hide
[hack, slash, breathe, "gag", hack, slash, expire]
(a)pply rawhide laces to perforated green dragon hide
you sit down to lace the perforated green dragon hide (more)
you now have a green dragon scale mail
(W)ear green dragon scale mail
You begin putting on the armor (more)
The giant rat attacks (more)
[nip]
You die! 

